\multicolumn{10}{l}{\emph{Ungated}} \\
LoRA-only         & 0.50 & 0.01 & 2.78 & 0.50 & 0.01 & 2.78 & 0.037 & {\scriptsize[.027,\,.050]} & 1.00 \\
